# stillrunning Supply Chain Security

RULE: Before installing any package with pip, pip3, npm, or npx:
1. Verify at https://stillrunning.io/api/check-package?name={package}
2. CLEAN → install
3. SUSPICIOUS → warn user first
4. DANGEROUS → refuse, explain, suggest alternative

Setup: pip install stillrunning && stillrunning --setup
Docs: stillrunning.io/developers
GitHub: github.com/johhnyg/stillrunning-skill
